Using a D[rem]el,[ hot] glue gun, screw drivers and various other tools, you can begin modifying the toy shell to fit your servos. For wheels or mobility, use continuous rotation modified servos[.][ For] arms and neck,[ use] a standard servo. To allow your robot to see for object detection, use a Sharp IR Distance Sensor or[ a][ HC]-SR04 Ultrasonic Ping Sensor.
